sequenceDiagram
 participant Requester
 participant Server as SvelteKit server
 participant DB as PostgreSQL
 Requester->>Server: Submit subject, description, category
 Server->>Server: Check session and permissions, validate input
 Server->>DB: SELECT active category
 Server->>DB: BEGIN
 Server->>DB: INSERT ticket (Normal priority, Open status)
 DB-->>Server: New ticket
 Server->>DB: INSERT ticket_event and requester follower
 opt Staff assigned it while creating
  Server->>DB: INSERT assignment event, assignee follower, notification
 end
 alt All writes succeed
  Server->>DB: COMMIT
  Server-->>Requester: Redirect to the new ticket
 else Any failure
  Server->>DB: ROLLBACK
  Server-->>Requester: Error, no ticket created
 end
